{
  "note": "fenshou成片字幕清单;lines为全片绝对时间(各clip真实时长累加,不用clip_order等长假设);静默镜无字幕",
  "total_dur_s": 63.85,
  "lines": [
    {
      "clip": "FS01",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "我们还是分手吧。",
      "t_start": 0.4,
      "t_end": 4.2
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS02",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "你……是不是又生气了。",
      "t_start": 4.758,
      "t_end": 7.358
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS02",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "没有。我想很久了。",
      "t_start": 7.558,
      "t_end": 9.408
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS03",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "上周不是还说好，周末去吃那家餐厅。",
      "t_start": 9.933,
      "t_end": 12.133
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS03",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "我记得。可你忘了——那天你加班，一条消息都没有。",
      "t_start": 12.333,
      "t_end": 14.633
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS04U1",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那天真的太忙。我不是故意的，我改。",
      "t_start": 15.108,
      "t_end": 19.008
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS04U2",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "不是那一件。你说我小题大做。",
      "t_start": 19.567,
      "t_end": 21.367
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS04U2",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "我等你，等到半夜。……后来，就不等了。",
      "t_start": 21.567,
      "t_end": 23.567
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS04U3",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "就为这些小事。",
      "t_start": 24.125,
      "t_end": 27.725
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS05U1",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "不是小事。我没怪你。是撑不住了。",
      "t_start": 28.483,
      "t_end": 32.383
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS05U2",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "可是我的失望，不会等你有空。",
      "t_start": 33.042,
      "t_end": 36.842
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS06U1",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我以为……我们还有很多时间。",
      "t_start": 37.5,
      "t_end": 41.3
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS06U3",
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "真的……没办法了吗。",
      "t_start": 46.317,
      "t_end": 48.617
    },
    {
      "clip": "FS06U3",
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "没有了。",
      "t_start": 48.917,
      "t_end": 50.217
    }
  ]
}